# Canonical route: the page's default route. The Stonescale-oil route is
# canonical at 250-300; the Superior Mana Potion alternative is named in a
# tip at 260-265 with its material list. All counts are the page's
# estimates: yellow recipes do not always give a skill point, so a few
# extra crafts are sometimes needed.
#
# Kept intermediates: Fire Oil made at 130-150 (40 made, 30 used for
# Elixir of Fire Power at 150-165) and Stonescale Oil made at 250-260
# (94 made, 88 used for Elixir of Greater Defense at 265-300). The craft
# steps say how many to keep; the material counts already include them.
#
# The 265-300 discrepancy, resolved from the Forever data: the page heads
# the step "Elixir of Greater Defense" but its recipe line names "Recipe:
# Elixir of Superior Defense". Both are right. The Forever spell is
# Elixir of Greater Defense (17554, reagents 2 Stonescale Oil, 1 Sungrass,
# 1 Crystal Vial), and the item that teaches it is still called Recipe:
# Elixir of Superior Defense (13478, sold by Kor'geld in Orgrimmar and
# Soolie Berryfizz in Ironforge). Classic's Elixir of Superior Defense was
# renamed Elixir of Greater Defense in Forever; Classic's Elixir of
# Greater Defense is Elixir of Defense (11450) here, a different recipe.
#
# Spell ids resolved from professions.json and the Forever client tables
# (build 1.60.1.70532, SkillLineAbility.csv + SpellName.csv +
# SpellReagents.csv), each cross-checked against the page's own material
# lists. Note: the learn skills in professions.json are Classic estimates
# and do not match Forever in several places (Minor Mana Potion is taught
# from 25 in Forever, Elixir of Wisdom from 90); the bands here follow the
# page's beta-tested route, and Polestar's own notes confirm several of
# the lower Forever learn skills.
guide forever-professions/alchemy
title Alchemy 1-300
category Professions
coords era
levels 1-60
zone Azeroth

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Apprentice

section Alchemy 1-55

step Learn Alchemy
  only Alliance
  zone Ironforge
  tip Alchemy takes a profession slot. Vosur Brakthel in Tinker Town, Ironforge, teaches Apprentice Alchemy at any character level. Alchemy pairs well with Herbalism: every herb on this route can be picked rather than bought.
  train Alchemy Apprentice npc 1246

step Learn Alchemy
  only Horde
  zone Orgrimmar
  tip Alchemy takes a profession slot. Whuut in Orgrimmar teaches Apprentice Alchemy at any character level. Alchemy pairs well with Herbalism: every herb on this route can be picked rather than bought.
  train Alchemy Apprentice npc 11046

step Alchemy 1-55: Auction House
  tip What the first elixirs take that the Auction House sells: 54 Silverleaf, 45 Peacebloom. The counts drop by what your bags, bank and mail hold.
  auction 765 x54
  auction 2447 x45

step Alchemy 1-55: herbs
  tip Silverleaf and Peacebloom are starter herbs: pick them in any starting zone while you level, or take them from your bank.
  collect 765 x54 anywhere gather Herbalism 1
  collect 2447 x45 anywhere gather Herbalism 1

step Alchemy 1-55: vendor goods
  tip Empty Vials come from Alchemy supply vendors; most trainers have one nearby.
  buy 3371 x54 nearest

step Elixir of Minor Force, Elixir of Minor Defense (1-55)
  tip Elixir of Minor Force, 9 brews to 10, then Elixir of Minor Defense, 45 brews to 55: a Silverleaf and a Peacebloom in each of the second. Both are taught with Apprentice Alchemy.
  learn 1245250 "Elixir of Minor Force"
  craft 1245250 "Elixir of Minor Force" until 10
  learn 7183 "Elixir of Minor Defense"
  craft 7183 "Elixir of Minor Defense" until 55

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Journeyman

section Alchemy 55-90

step Journeyman Alchemy
  only Alliance
  zone Ironforge
  tip Journeyman Alchemy raises the cap to 150; it needs skill 50 and character level 10. Tally Berryfizz in Ironforge teaches it.
  level 10
  train Alchemy Journeyman npc 5177

step Journeyman Alchemy
  only Horde
  zone Orgrimmar
  tip Journeyman Alchemy raises the cap to 150; it needs skill 50 and character level 10. Yelmak in Orgrimmar teaches it.
  level 10
  train Alchemy Journeyman npc 3347

step Alchemy 55-90: Auction House
  tip What the next potions take that the Auction House sells: 10 Mageroyal, 38 Peacebloom, 56 Earthroot. The counts drop by what your bags, bank and mail hold.
  auction 785 x10
  auction 2447 x38
  auction 2449 x56

step Alchemy 55-90: herbs
  tip Mageroyal grows in the 10-25 zones, Earthroot in the starting zones and the 10-20 zones. Pick them while you level, or take them from your bank.
  collect 785 x10 anywhere gather Herbalism 50
  collect 2447 x38 anywhere gather Herbalism 1
  collect 2449 x56 anywhere gather Herbalism 15

step Alchemy 55-90: vendor goods
  tip Empty Vials come from Alchemy supply vendors; most trainers have one nearby.
  buy 3371 x38 nearest

step Minor Mana Potion, Elixir of Minor Fortitude (55-90)
  tip Minor Mana Potion, 10 brews to 65, then Elixir of Minor Fortitude, 28 brews to 90: two Earthroot in each of the second. In Forever the trainer teaches Minor Mana Potion from skill 25, well before this band.
  learn 2331 "Minor Mana Potion"
  craft 2331 "Minor Mana Potion" until 65
  learn 2334 "Elixir of Minor Fortitude"
  craft 2334 "Elixir of Minor Fortitude" until 90

section Alchemy 90-130

step Alchemy 90-130: Auction House
  tip What the next elixirs take that the Auction House sells: 40 Mageroyal, 60 Briarthorn, 10 Stranglekelp. The counts drop by what your bags, bank and mail hold.
  auction 785 x40
  auction 2450 x60
  auction 3820 x10

step Alchemy 90-130: herbs
  tip Briarthorn grows in the 10-25 zones; Stranglekelp grows along coasts and riverbanks in the 10-30 zones. Pick them while you level, or take them from your bank.
  collect 785 x40 anywhere gather Herbalism 50
  collect 2450 x60 anywhere gather Herbalism 70
  collect 3820 x10 anywhere gather Herbalism 85

step Alchemy 90-130: vendor goods
  tip Empty Vials come from Alchemy supply vendors; most trainers have one nearby.
  buy 3371 x40 nearest

step Elixir of Wisdom, Lesser Mana Potion (90-130)
  tip Elixir of Wisdom, 30 brews to 120: two Briarthorn in each. Then Lesser Mana Potion, 10 brews to 130. Keep the Elixirs of Wisdom if you also level Tailoring: the Gloves of Meditation need them.
  learn 3171 "Elixir of Wisdom"
  craft 3171 "Elixir of Wisdom" until 120
  learn 3173 "Lesser Mana Potion"
  craft 3173 "Lesser Mana Potion" until 130

section Alchemy 130-150

step Alchemy 130-150: Auction House
  tip What Fire Oil takes that the Auction House sells: 40 Firefin Snapper. The counts drop by what your bags, bank and mail hold.
  auction 6359 x40

step Alchemy 130-150: fish
  tip Firefin Snapper is fished in mid-level waters: catch them yourself, or take them from your bank.
  collect 6359 x40 anywhere gather Fishing 75

step Alchemy 130-150: vendor goods
  tip Empty Vials come from Alchemy supply vendors; most trainers have one nearby.
  buy 3371 x20 nearest

step Fire Oil (130-150)
  tip Fire Oil, 20 brews to 150. Each brew makes two oils, so you end with 40: keep 30 of them for the Elixir of Fire Power next. Fire Oil is cheaper here than more Lesser Mana Potions, and the next step needs it anyway.
  learn 7837 "Fire Oil"
  craft 7837 "Fire Oil" until 150

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Expert

section Alchemy 150-195

step Expert Alchemy
  only Alliance
  zone Darnassus
  tip Expert Alchemy raises the cap to 225; it needs skill 125 and character level 20, and costs 50 silver. Ainethil in Darnassus teaches it.
  level 20
  train Alchemy Expert npc 4160

step Expert Alchemy
  only Horde
  zone Undercity
  tip Expert Alchemy raises the cap to 225; it needs skill 125 and character level 20, and costs 50 silver. Doctor Herbert Halsey in the Undercity teaches it.
  level 20
  train Alchemy Expert npc 4611

step Alchemy 150-195: Auction House
  tip What the next potions take that the Auction House sells: 51 Kingsblood, 36 Stranglekelp. The counts drop by what your bags, bank and mail hold.
  auction 3356 x51
  auction 3820 x36

step Alchemy 150-195: herbs
  tip Kingsblood grows in the 20-35 zones; Stranglekelp grows along coasts and riverbanks in the 10-30 zones. Pick them while you level, or take them from your bank.
  collect 3356 x51 anywhere gather Herbalism 125
  collect 3820 x36 anywhere gather Herbalism 85

step Alchemy 150-195: vendor goods
  tip Leaded Vials come from Alchemy supply vendors. Starting-zone vendors do not sell them: buy them in a capital city.
  buy 3372 x51 nearest

step Elixir of Fire Power, Mana Potion (150-195)
  tip Elixir of Fire Power, 15 brews to 165: two of the kept Fire Oils in each. Then Mana Potion, 36 brews to 195.
  learn 7845 "Elixir of Fire Power"
  craft 7845 "Elixir of Fire Power" until 165
  learn 3452 "Mana Potion"
  craft 3452 "Mana Potion" until 195

section Alchemy 195-225

step Alchemy 195-225: Auction House
  tip What the Nature Protection Potions take that the Auction House sells: 36 Liferoot, 36 Stranglekelp. The counts drop by what your bags, bank and mail hold.
  auction 3357 x36
  auction 3820 x36

step Alchemy 195-225: herbs
  tip Liferoot grows along water in the 30-40 zones; Stranglekelp grows along coasts and riverbanks in the 10-30 zones. Pick them while you level, or take them from your bank.
  collect 3357 x36 anywhere gather Herbalism 150
  collect 3820 x36 anywhere gather Herbalism 85

step Alchemy 195-225: vendor goods
  tip Leaded Vials come from Alchemy supply vendors in capital cities.
  buy 3372 x36 nearest

step Recipe: Nature Protection Potion
  tip The recipe is sold by Bronk and Logannas in Feralas, Glyx Brewright in Stranglethorn Vale, and Alchemist Pestlezugg in Tanaris. It binds when picked up: buy it with the character leveling Alchemy.
  buy 6057 x1 nearest

step Nature Protection Potion (195-225)
  tip Nature Protection Potion, 36 brews to 225. Use the recipe first to learn it.
  learn 7259 "Nature Protection Potion"
  craft 7259 "Nature Protection Potion" until 225

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Artisan

section Alchemy 225-250

step Artisan Alchemy
  only Alliance
  zone Feralas
  tip Artisan Alchemy raises the cap to 300; it needs skill 200 and character level 35. Kylanna Windwhisper at Feathermoon Stronghold in Feralas teaches it.
  level 35
  train Alchemy Artisan npc 7948

step Artisan Alchemy
  only Horde
  zone Swamp of Sorrows
  tip Artisan Alchemy raises the cap to 300; it needs skill 200 and character level 35. Rogvar in Stonard, Swamp of Sorrows, teaches it.
  level 35
  train Alchemy Artisan npc 1386

step Alchemy 225-250: Auction House
  tip What the next potions take that the Auction House sells: 26 Liferoot, 26 Stranglekelp, 15 Blindweed, 15 Khadgar's Whisker. The counts drop by what your bags, bank and mail hold.
  auction 3357 x26
  auction 3820 x26
  auction 8839 x15
  auction 3358 x15

step Alchemy 225-250: herbs
  tip Liferoot grows along water in the 30-40 zones; Blindweed grows in the 40-50 zones and Khadgar's Whisker in the 25-40 zones. Pick them while you level, or take them from your bank.
  collect 3357 x26 anywhere gather Herbalism 150
  collect 3820 x26 anywhere gather Herbalism 85
  collect 8839 x15 anywhere gather Herbalism 235
  collect 3358 x15 anywhere gather Herbalism 160

step Alchemy 225-250: vendor goods
  tip Leaded Vials and Crystal Vials come from Alchemy supply vendors in capital cities.
  buy 3372 x26 nearest
  buy 8925 x15 nearest

step Nature Protection Potion, Elixir of Greater Intellect (225-250)
  tip Nature Protection Potion, 26 more brews to 235, then Elixir of Greater Intellect, 15 brews to 250.
  craft 7259 "Nature Protection Potion" until 235
  learn 11465 "Elixir of Greater Intellect"
  craft 11465 "Elixir of Greater Intellect" until 250

section Alchemy 250-265

step Alchemy 250-265: Auction House
  tip What the next brews take that the Auction House sells: 47 Stonescale Eel, 10 Blindweed, 10 Khadgar's Whisker. The counts drop by what your bags, bank and mail hold.
  auction 13422 x47
  auction 8839 x10
  auction 3358 x10

step Alchemy 250-265: fish and herbs
  tip Stonescale Eel is fished from Stonescale Eel schools on the coasts of the 40-55 zones. Blindweed grows in the 40-50 zones and Khadgar's Whisker in the 25-40 zones.
  collect 13422 x47 anywhere gather Fishing 205
  collect 8839 x10 anywhere gather Herbalism 235
  collect 3358 x10 anywhere gather Herbalism 160

step Alchemy 250-265: vendor goods
  tip Leaded Vials and Crystal Vials come from Alchemy supply vendors in capital cities.
  buy 3372 x47 nearest
  buy 8925 x10 nearest

step Stonescale Oil, Elixir of Greater Intellect (250-265)
  tip Stonescale Oil, 47 brews to 260. Each brew makes two oils, so you end with 94: keep all of them for the Elixir of Greater Defense next. Then Elixir of Greater Intellect, 10 more brews to 265. If Stonescale Eel is expensive, skip the oil, keep making Elixir of Greater Intellect to 265 (about 21 more), and finish on Superior Mana Potions instead: 55 brews to 300 (110 Sungrass, 110 Blindweed, 55 Crystal Vial), recipe from Algernon in the Undercity or Ulthir in Darnassus.
  learn 17551 "Stonescale Oil"
  craft 17551 "Stonescale Oil" until 260
  craft 11465 "Elixir of Greater Intellect" until 265

section Alchemy 265-300

step Alchemy 265-300: Auction House
  tip What the last elixirs take that the Auction House sells: 44 Sungrass. The counts drop by what your bags, bank and mail hold.
  auction 8838 x44

step Alchemy 265-300: herbs
  tip Sungrass grows in the 40-55 zones: pick it while you level, or take it from your bank.
  collect 8838 x44 anywhere gather Herbalism 230

step Alchemy 265-300: vendor goods
  tip Crystal Vials come from Alchemy supply vendors in capital cities.
  buy 8925 x44 nearest

step Recipe: Elixir of Superior Defense
  tip The recipe item is still called Recipe: Elixir of Superior Defense, and it teaches Elixir of Greater Defense: the elixir was renamed in Forever, the recipe item was not. Sold by Kor'geld in Orgrimmar and Soolie Berryfizz in Ironforge, limited stock.
  buy 13478 x1 nearest

step Elixir of Greater Defense (265-300)
  tip Elixir of Greater Defense, 44 brews to 300: two of the kept Stonescale Oils in each. It turns yellow at 280, so make a few more if you come up short of 300. Use the recipe first to learn it.
  learn 17554 "Elixir of Greater Defense"
  craft 17554 "Elixir of Greater Defense" until 300
